 "findings": [
  "Squarespace site built about 2016-2017 under the bar's corporate name; the pizza shop has no identity of its own online.",
  "The \"Brookside Pizza II Menu\" page contains no menu, only the address; the Tap menu page shows leftover block labels.",
  "The only real menu is two crooked phone photos of the paper menu plus 2017 catering scans with \"to Upload\" in the file names.",
  "Sidebar on every page says the whole business is open 11AM-12AM daily; the paper menu says the restaurant closes at 9 or 10 PM and only the bar runs to midnight.",
  "No online ordering and three phone numbers with no clear call-to-order button.",
  "About text has typos and reads like a 2009 update; merch and bar photos outweigh the pizza."
 ],
 "questions": [
  "What time does the bar open each day? Only \"open till midnight 7 days\" is published.",
  "Do the restaurant hours on the paper menu (Mon-Thu and Sun 11-9, Fri-Sat 11-10) match what you want shown? Does the kitchen stop at the same time?",
  "Which phone number should be the main call-to-order number: 603-267-6968 or 603-267-7407?",
  "What are the delivery area, fee and minimum? The menu only says \"Belmont and surrounding towns\".",
  "Do you want online ordering? If so, which system? The site is call-to-order today.",
  "Please send dessert prices and any menu changes since the paper menu was printed (it says prices may change).",
  "Is the Facebook page the right social link, and is the Instagram (the Tap's account) the one to feature?",
  "Do you own the photos and OK their reuse? They came from your website, Facebook and Instagram.",
  "Is the story text (Christine, 1999, 2003, The Tap in 2006, 2009 reopening) right, and do you want the community section (DARE, Sportsmen's Club, TEAM FEED, police helmets) kept?",
